{"id": "9681", "type": "page", "slug": "ambassadors", "path": "ambassadors", "title": "Ambassadors", "date": "2026-08-17 17:24:49", "modified": "2026-08-25 18:12:01", "excerpt": "", "content": "<section><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-ambassadors-hero-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\nHippocrates Ambassadors\r\n<h1>A different vision of wellness, shared in your own voice</h1>\r\nHippocrates partners with a small number of creators and educators whose work already speaks to the people we hope to reach. If that sounds like yours, tell us about it.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"#apply\">Express interest→</a>\r\n<a href=\"#fit\">See who we partner with→</a>\r\n\r\n</section><section>The partnership\r\n<h2>For Life! The Hippocrates Wellness Alumni Community, for everyone who has walked the campus and carried it home.</h2>\r\nHelp us build a lasting home for the deepest work that happens here. Your gift to the campus shapes the physical place where the next seventy years of healing will unfold, for every guest who walks through the door after you.\r\n\r\nYou came as a guest. You leave as family. And family always has a way home.\r\n<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-ambassadors-story-2.jpg\" alt=\"Two guests walking bicycles along a path on the Hippocrates campus\" /></figure>\r\n</section><section>Who we partner with\r\n<h2>What we look for</h2>\r\n01\r\nAn established platform\r\nA channel, publication or podcast you have built and continue to publish on.\r\n02\r\nA community that listens\r\nPeople who take your recommendations seriously — whatever the size of the audience.\r\n03\r\nRelevant subject matter\r\nWellness, nutrition, education, longevity or lifestyle work that sits naturally alongside ours.\r\n04\r\nHonest storytelling\r\nYou are comfortable describing an experience as you found it, including the parts that surprised you.\r\n05\r\nProgram\r\nWork you are proud of, produced to a standard you control.\r\n06\r\nGenuine curiosity\r\nAn interest in experiencing Hippocrates firsthand before speaking about it.\r\n\r\n</section><section>How it works\r\n<h2>Experience first. Story second.</h2>\r\nThere are moments when an institution must do more than celebrate its past.\r\n\r\nPartners are like-minded individuals or companies wanting to collaborate to\r\n<ol>\r\n \t<li>Share the Story: we grow through the people and organizations who share our vision;</li>\r\n \t<li>Build a relationship with the outcome of connecting people to better opportunity for optimal health.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\nWe partner across every kind of alignment — from clinical and wellness innovators like Dr Jan Hrnrenky, BrainTap and the Longevity Center, to influential voices such as Jeff Beacher and Jen Heller, to retreat and creative collaborators including Loren Lahav and Stay True Creative Productions. We're also proud to partner with Kaia Roman on the documentary Frequency.\r\n\r\nAs the movement grows, so do the opportunities to align — and they are endless.\r\n<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-alumni-campus-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure>\r\n</section><section>Express interest\r\n<h2>Tell us about your work</h2>\r\nWe are always looking for relationships with like-minded, heart-centered, community focused wellness providers and organizations.\r\n\r\nArrangements, expectations and terms are shared privately with partners we take forward.\r\n\r\nNothing about them is published here.\r\n\r\nFields marked are required. We don’t ask for health, medical or financial information here. *\r\n\r\n<style>.elementor-9886 .elementor-element.elementor-element-4c7551e9{--display:flex;}.elementor-widget-form .elementor-field-group > label, .elementor-widget-form .elementor-field-subgroup label{color:var( --e-global-color-text );}.elementor-widget-form .elementor-field-group > label{font-family:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-size );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weigh